Subject: [PATCH] drm/gma500: add SGX TA ioctl request object

---
 drivers/gpu/drm/gma500/psb_drv.c | 319 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 246 insertions(+), 73 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/gma500/psb_drv.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/gma500/psb_drv.c
